# Replay comparison rulings for the `major-handoff` family (agents/replay/fixtures/major-handoff/, read-only) — tests/compare.py.
# One line per row whose old-member stream differs from the new component's (or that is not liftable):
#   <row id> | spec|old|new | <one line of reason>
# spec = the page is wrong (fix the page) · old = the old member is wrong (the page says so) ·
# new = the component is wrong (fix it). A ruling for a row that does not differ fails the suite.
